window.products.push({"id":1075277,"name":"HOTNIU 1 Piece Printed Stretch Sofa Slipcover Non Slip Soft Couch Sofa Cover Washable Furniture Protector Sofa Cover with 1 Pillowcase for Armchair Lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zjny3zJcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Name: HOTNIU 1-Piece Printed Stretch Sofa Cover- Universal Fitted Elastic Soft Polyester Spandex Furniture Slipcovers- Modern Stylish Sofa Protector Covers HOTNIU Decorative Cushion Cover is the simple yet classic way to instantly brighten up your home or decor. Available in a variety of fresh, on-trend stylish patterns and colors. Offers a timelessly stylish aesthetic to your furniture decor, Looks great all year round, you're sure to find the one that suits the rest of your decor. Features: -Soft Polyester Spandex fabric with high elasticity ensures maximum comfortable with perfect wrinklefree fitting all around. -The highly elastic fabric is also thick enough to protect sofa against dust, stains and other damages. Universal suitable to over 99% home sofa size between: - 1 seat : Chair length between 35\" - 51\" (90 -130 cm) - 2 seat : Loveseat length between 53\" - 67\" (135 -170 cm) - 3 seat : Sofa length between 69\" - 86\" (175 - 220 cm) - 4 seat : Big Sofa length between 88\" - 114\" (225 - 290 cm) How to install: Steps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back Steps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight Steps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly Steps 4: Put the sofa down and pull the cover tight along with excess fabric to the back Steps 5: Enjoy your newly covered sofa! Kindly Reminder: - Due to the different monitors of each computer and the impact of shooting light, the uploaded picture and the real product can be slightly different. - Due to the different size of the sofa gap, the foam pieces may sometimes not work very well when the gap is too big or too small.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Zjny3zJcL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTNIU","source_asin":"B07V1N98BN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V1N98BN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V1N98BN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
