window.products.push({"id":1075293,"name":"Origami Coffee Mug 11 oz. Origami funny gift.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xNmQxYU3L._AC_SL1148_.jpg","description":"Creativity: Buy awesome Origami coffee mug for the one you know, the one you work with or the one with you are related to! The unique and funny coffee or tea cup is a great way to express your love and gratitude towards your special one. That special one may be your friend, parent, better half, colleague, your boy or girl friend. It doesn’t a matter. Creative gifts will be liked by all. Best Quality: We will do our best and will supply you with a high quality ceramic mug printed in the USA. All ceramic cups are dishwasher and microwave safe with with large easy grip handle. The imprinted is printed on both sides of the mug and guaranteed to last. 100% total and complete satisfaction guaranteed! Unique and funny: There are only few things that have the power to connect people from all around the world. Coffee is one such thing. This unique Origami mug is a great occasion to discuss a lot with just a cup of coffee in our hands. Nothing can make people happier than holding a cup of hot coffee with some uncommon coffee mugs. So gifting the funny coffee mugs is a great idea to make them remember you with every sip they take. Stylish: Hold a stylish and awesome coffee mug in your hand, you make a stylish statement in a silent way. Get the unique custom coffee cups with unforgettable title I'm not anti-social I'd just rather be doing origami than talking to people , add to your collection and show how awesome you are. Memorable: Unique and Funny coffee mugs are intended for coffee lovers and also for all who enjoy the quality of art. When you buy our personalized coffee mug to someone, either they will preserve it to their collections or they will find a cup of coffee for themselves. Whatever it may be they will remember you every morning. Design:Y32","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xNmQxYU3L._AC_SL1148_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderful Mugs","source_asin":"B07BVFD8SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVFD8SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVFD8SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1075294,"name":"Helpcook Ice Ball Molds 4 Pack - Silicone Sphere Ice Molds with Built-in Funnel - 2.5 Inch Round Ice Cube Molds Ice Ball Maker Makes Large Ice Balls f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xZG3PtmyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Sphere Ice Molds,Whiskey Ice Ball Maker - Makes 2.5 Inch Ice Balls Helpcook Round Ice Cube Molds make unique 'giant' ice balls that take much longer to melt than regular ice cubes, so you can effectively chill your drink without diluting it! The extra-large 2.5\" spheres size is perfect for your cocktail favorites. Use these molds to add a unique touch to your cocktails, whiskry,spirits, lemonade, iced tea, cold brew coffee, soda, and more! Product Specification: Package:4 pack sphere ice molds（Black） Material:Food Grade Silicone Each mould weight :2.26 ounces Size : 2.76 x 2.76 x 2.95 inches Why Choose Helpcook Silicone Ice Ball Molds? ▪ The Sphere Ice Molds Made of High-Quality Food-Grade Silicone, BPA-free. Can be used in the freezer, microwave, and dishwasher. ▪ 2.5 inch slow-melting ice balls: Long-lasting ice balls for cocktail, iced coffee, iced tea, fruit juice,Scotch Whisky, Bourbon or Blended Whiskey. ▪ Unique funnel-shaped water injection design: Allows you to easily fill the water without using an extra funnel.Provide a better user experience. ▪ Multi-purpose:Along with creating ice sphere balls, our molds can be used for home-made chocolates,popsicle, jellos, soaps, candles and more. ▪ With its ease of use, our large ice sphere molds easily pops out.they are the best compliment your home bar! ▪Made to Last, reduces waste & saves money. ▪Your skin care artifact:This is different sphere ice tray.It is not only a ice cube mold, but also a practical skin care artifact.It is also ideal for use as ice roller for face and eye, rolling ice deepen contours repairs skin. Thank you for reading. Any problem, please feel free to contact me. 100% risk-free purchase. Simply contact us to return the product for a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xZG3PtmyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Helpcook","source_asin":"B07S782HV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S782HV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S782HV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
