window.products.push({"id":1075384,"name":"Wilton Easy Layers Cake Pan Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3TvPcHyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Save yourself the trouble of torting your cakes when you want to make a trendy, tall, multilayer cake. 5-Piece Halloween Easy Layers 6 Inch Cake Pan Set is perfect for decorating a candy corn-themed cake! Just color cake batter and icing in alternating orange, yellow and white to make the perfect Halloween treat. With this set of 6 in. pans, you can make a five-layer cake with ease for a definite “wow” factor! One cake mix or a single batch of batter is enough to fill all five pans, and most ovens have the space to accommodate all five pans baking at once. The pans in this innovative set are ¾ in. thick, the perfect depth for a multilayered cake, and the non-stick pan coating means your cake will release and clean up with ease. This versatile pan set is also great for layered ombré cakes, (tinting the batter in five gradations of color), or a rainbow cake, (using a different icing color to tint each layer). Bake a chocolate cake with different fillings separating the layers or mix different flavors into each layer for a taste sensation. Stack up a naked cake, (one where the layering is the star because the exterior of the cake isn’t iced). Or, create a classic torte filled with whipped cream, mousse or fruit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e3TvPcHyL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B00UY0W2UC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UY0W2UC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UY0W2UC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
