window.products.push({"id":1075575,"name":"Portable Blender (A)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YCi0mpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful and effective】This portable blender is equipped with 6 ultra-sharp 304 stainless steel blades, and 7.4 V pure copper motor. With a higher level of rotation frequency about 1,8000 times per minutes, it only takes 30 seconds to bring you a cup of fresh smoothie, shakes, fresh juices, masks etc. 【Rechargeable and Portable】Built-in 2000mh rechargeable battery, it can be fully charged by about 3-5 hours.Once the blender is fully charged, it can produce 25-30 cups of juice.18 Oz capacity and only 1 lb product weight make it easy to carry around in any circumstances.This portable juicer is also a suitable gift for juice and travel enthusiasts, suitable for indoor and outdoor activities. 【Food-Grade Material and Safety Design】The portable blender fits in most standard size cup holders and portable design is made from eco-friendly, food-grade non-toxic PCTG material, BPA free. The rechargeable portable blender will stop blading automatically when the body and base are not properly assembled. 【Easy operation and one button control】The small blender is easy to clean by adding water and double click the power button to  to start the self-cleaning mode. It comes with a cleaning brush for you to clean the inside corners of the juicer cup. For safety concern, please do not soak the blender into water. 【Multi-Function and After-sales service】This Black blender is great for making nutritious single-portion smoothies, juice blends, mix fruits and vegetables, coffee, milk powder, protein shake, baby supplementary food. it also can be used as common bottle. Ideal for any kitchen, office or outdoor.If there is a problem with the product, please contact us in time, we provide one-year warranty service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716YCi0mpcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aisihai","source_asin":"B096XV1B9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XV1B9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XV1B9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
