window.products.push({"id":1075647,"name":"Commercial Deep Fryer with Basket, 3400W 12.7QT/12L Electric Deep Fryers for Restaurant or Home Use, Detachable Large Capacity Stainless Steel Counter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":165.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710H3ruCASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<ul> <li>【COMMERCIAL DEEP FRYER】 This Deep Fryer with Basket is equipped with a 1700W×2 heating tube for each basin, heating oil quickly and evenly and well temperature control,Ensuring professional healthier and minimal oil absorption while frying .It can perform two frying operations simultaneously or individually while maintaining the targeted temperature you set.There are 2×10.7QT oil tank and 2×6.35QT baskets,ideal size for commercial or home use</li> <li>【EASY TO OPERATE,EASY TO CLEAN】 The electric deep fryer is simple to work. After adding the right amount of oil, plug in the plug and control the tank through the temperature knob. You can choose the appropriate temperature based on the food. Equipped with a convenient hanging basket hook to screen out excess oil and return it to the tank. All parts can be disassembled for cleaning, which is very convenient (except for the heating element, which cannot be disassembled)</li> <li>【RELIABLE TEMPRATURE CONTROL】    This electric fryer can be heated from 140°F (60°C) up to 390°F (200°C) , each tank is equipped with powerful heating elements, using a \"U\" shaped heating element design for better evenly heating distribution, the high-quality adjustable temperature knob used in this  fryer, can guarantee the heating of the oil and the constant temperature, based on the temperature setting.</li> <li>【OPTIMIZED STRUCTURAL DESIGN,HIGH QUALITY 】The electric deep fryer adopts high-quality stainless steel, 0.6mm thick stainless steel structure design, solid structure, 0.7mm heavy-duty tank and is equipped with a convenient handle, which is more convenient and durable; the large frying basket adopts a square mesh design , more durable.</li> <li>【WIDELY USE】 It's a practical electric deep fryer to fry chips, fish, chicken, doughnuts, fritters, onion rings, shrimp and more for home use and commercial use.  WARM TIPS After adding an appropriate amount of oil to the tank, plug in the socket and turn on the temperature switch to heat. It is forbidden to dry heating the empty tank, which is easy to damage. If you have any problems in use, please feel free to contact us.</li></ul>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710H3ruCASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tooya","source_asin":"B09XH1WH56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075647","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XH1WH56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XH1WH56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
