window.products.push({"id":1075697,"name":"Korean Chopsticks and Spoon Set Decorated with Heron Illustration and a Chinese Letter Means 'Longevity'.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygA6u6TML._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Korean metal spoon and chopsticks. This good quality tableware is easy to grip and clean. Perfect tools for Asian cuisine such as rice, soup and side dishes.  A pair of metal spoon and chopsticks stored in a paper box, so good for gift.  If the wooden sticks were used in the past, nowadays, Koreans use metal chopsticks flat. Use longer and use cleaner. These are strong.  This spoon and chopsticks are decorated with heron and chinese letter 'Jang - means Longevity'. Good for parents and grandparents.  This is a nice decoration items for your festive meals and Asian themed cuisine table.  It is well-known fact that using chopstick is good for brain development and prevention of dementia.  This would be a great gift for anyone. And also could be your favorite tableware for your special meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygA6u6TML._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Korean Treasures","source_asin":"B00BMJBKJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BMJBKJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BMJBKJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
