window.products.push({"id":1075764,"name":"MEEDEN White Board Wood Drafting Table,Art Craft Desk with Height Adjustable & Tilted Large Surface Tabletop,Drawing Desk and Hobby Table,Sketching Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":118.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UGNW4-HWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STURDY AND DURABLE. The drafting table made of superb solid pine wood,not easily deformed.H-frame construction ensures the stability of the table and avoids shaking.Thickened legs enhance the load-bearing capacity of the table.Designed with white tabletop,clean and smooth surface. ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT & TABLETOP. The drafting table provides 7 angles from flat to 45°,adjust a comfortable and suitable position flexibly.6 holes on the legs means you can freely adjust the height of the table between 26\"-33\". All accessories can work well for a long lifetime. MULTIPLE USES. The high quality drafting table is not only designed for painting creation,but can be used as a study desk,architectural drawing desk,computer desk,craft desk,hobby table.It can be placed in bedroom,art studio,school,office,etc.Convenient and practical,occupying a small space. VERSATILE FUNCTIONS. Ample tabletop surface allows you to work freely.24\" T-square ruler with clear scale and inch & metric calibrations,it can effectively fix the drawing paper and assist dimension in drawing.The build-in pencil ledge holds brushes,pencils,paints or other painting tools,preventing them from falling. MEEDEN for ULTIMATE SATISFACTION. MEEDEN is more like a family with hundreds of members wholly dedicated to helping you succeed in your artistic endeavors through high-quality, unique art supplies. And like a family, we stick together, and if anything goes south, you can always rely on MEEDEN, through thick and thin - give us a little sign - a mail, a call, or a message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UGNW4-HWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEEDEN","source_asin":"B0C7ZWLW5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7ZWLW5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7ZWLW5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
