window.products.push({"id":1075800,"name":"Wood Cutting Board with Containers - Beautiful Acacia Wood meal prep deck station with drawers. Premium material prepdeck with trays and graters.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Wood Cutting Board with Containers - Beautiful acacia wood meal prep deck station with drawers/bins for your kitchen. Durable and right-sized prepdeck with trays and complimentary graters. Premium Material – Acacia wood is durable yet soft and protect the sharpness of knives. This beautiful cutting board with containers is a perfect gift for your wife, mother or love ones. Strong and Durable – This acacia wood cutting board is best crafted to provide a strong, durable surface for all of your food preparation and cutting tasks. Impress your guests like a professional chef by presenting your food using this naturally beautiful food station. Easy to Use – This 17.5'' x 12.4'' cutting board with storage is the right size for all kinds of food prep. The double-sided chopping station caters to left- and right-handed use. The prep deck is designed with juice grooves to catch excess juices for a mess-free countertop. Easily move the cutting board from the countertop to the table with the indented handle on both sides. Rounded corners on all sides for a safe environment to prepare food. Large Storage and Easy to Organise – Capacity of over 4.5 litres with 4 stackable containers/drawers. Each drawer comes with individual lids and fit nicely into freezers. Ideal to organise your ingredients. Just chop the ingredients and slide them into the containers through the large opening. Containers are transparent, durable, light and microwave and dishwasher safe. Easy food prep with 4 colourful graters for different grating needs. Grater grooves on the drop zone to hold the grater. Safe and Easy to Clean Up – Eat with peace knowing that wood has the potential to be one of the safest and most hygienic boards to prepare food with. It is also easy to clean up. Just wash your board after each use with soap and warm water, then allow it to dry completely.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AgapeCove","source_asin":"B08XZQFRJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZQFRJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZQFRJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
