window.products.push({"id":1075833,"name":"Queen Mattress, SOFTSEA 8 Inch Cool Gel Memory Foam Mattress in a Box for a Medium Comfort","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoSS3QIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Gel Memory Foam?Gel memory foam mattresses are made by either adding gel beads (capsules filled with gel) to memory foam, swirling liquid gel into memory foam, or adding gel on top of the comfort layer. Cooling gel helps in dissipating heat, allowing you to sleep cool while retaining memory foam’s original body-conforming and pressure-relieving features.Why Choose Gel Memory Foam? - From A BuyerThings have come a long way since the introduction of traditional memory foam, and, in my experience, cool memory foam mattresses utilizing gel properties helped me stay significantly cooler. They also typically incorporate a combination of additional layers to help prevent you from sinking in too far, thus feeling stuck.Product DetailsComfort Level: MediumMattress Type: Gel Memory FoamMattress Top Type: Tight topMattress overall size: 60\" x 80\" x 8\"Mattress Overall Product Weight: 45 PoundsNumber of Layers: 3Mattress Thickness: 8\"（1.5\" gel memory foam + 2\" Pressure Relief Comfort Foam + 4.5\" high-density support foam )Cover Material: Premium three-dimensional KnitCertifications: CertiPUR-US CertifiedCountry of Origin: Malaysia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HoSS3QIsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOFTSEA","source_asin":"B08HXB21T2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HXB21T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HXB21T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
