window.products.push({"id":1075854,"name":"Zojirushi Supreme Air Pot Beverage Dispenser, 3.0 L, Polished Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDKlWrkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Supreme air pot beverage dispenser use a non-electric, pump system to dispense beverages, freeing them from having to be placed near electrical sources. Because they are standing dispensers without the need to lift and pour, air pot dispensers are perfect for large capacities without the need for constant refilling. Vacuum insulation allows filling with icy cold drinks without concern for condensation on the outside. Hot drinks will also keep their temperature for hours, for a truly convenient self-service station.starting temperature of 203°F (95°C) at a room temperature of 68°F (20°C) Amazon.com This quality thermal pot is one you'll reach for repeatedly during those cold winter nights or hot summer afternoons. For icy cold beverages, pre-rinse with cold water, fill with your favorite beverage, and then drop in a few ice cubes. (Don't do the ice first, as the liner can crack with sudden temperature changes.) For hot coffee or chocolate, just rinse with warm water and then fill up. This large-capacity pot does a terrific job of keeping that morning coffee hot and fresh until lunchtime, but it is fragile enough that kids may need a hands-off policy. The pump-top dispenser prevents you from having to lift a heavy pitcher--just press the lid until you cup is full. Great for small offices and convenient for social occasions--or anywhere you want to have piping hot or frosty cool drinks available with minimal fuss. --Jill Lightner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDKlWrkJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zojirushi","source_asin":"B000M4ZZIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000M4ZZIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000M4ZZIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
