window.products.push({"id":1075886,"name":"Soobest Digital Wall Clock with Seconds, Electric Clock Plug Auto DST Dimmer LED Large Display 11.5 Inches (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615y7fXoQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Led screen with large digits display - Soobest digital wall clock has a 11.5 inches large led screen display with 3 inches eye-catching number display, there is no doubt that you can see it from any angle or at any indoor-distance, and the digit size is also big enough to recognize. Besides, you could check date & year on the screen, no worries about missing important appointment. Wall clock with seconds display - This large led wall clock could display seconds on its screen. Seconds display is definitely a useful detail for a digital clock. It could help you set time with a better accuracy without missing dozens of seconds. What’s more, you could arrange your body-shaping plan with this seconds display as a gym timer. Different brightness dimmer - 5 levels adjustable dimmer, no matter the environment is too bright or too dark you can still see the time by adjusting the brightness with 1 button. If you want to have a good sleep, just set the lowest brightness before going to bed, or turn to the most shining level while your room has sufficient lighting. AUTO DST and 12/24 switch - If you live in an area that observes daylight saving time, auto DST should be set to ON by pressing the DST button. Once you turn it on, it will spring forward/fall back automatically. In addition, the large time display of this digital clock could switch to normal time or military time format. User-friendly operation and suit for multiple situations - The wall clock so easy to operate that only 4 buttons with clear instructive icons needed to finish all the setting procedure. No matter where you put it, such as gym, kitchen, living room, bedroom, classroom, office, nursing home, or other indoor places, the clock will always show you the time like Polaris. Wall mount design and 70 inches cable - 70 inches cable ensure that the electric power could light up to the clock even at a high place. The 2 hanging holes at back, hanging nails and ruler (included) help you stick the clock on the wall, saving more space than normal table mounting clock and you could see it with a glimpse. Power operate and battery back-up - Power adapter (included) operates this digital wall clock. Battery back-up function could help you get rid of resetting time & alarm after power outage with 2 AAA batteries (not included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615y7fXoQ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soobest","source_asin":"B0B7RWR7PZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7RWR7PZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7RWR7PZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
