window.products.push({"id":1075953,"name":"Commercial French Fry Cutter Stainless Steel French Fries Cutter Handheld Veggie Slicer Potato Chopper for Fries with 3/8\", 1/2\" Blades, Cleaning Brus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJ1ap6iyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Body Potatoes Cutter: Aluminum alloy body, waterproof, rust-proof and easy to clean; Food grade aluminum alloy push plate, safe and hygienic, high strength and not easy to deform; Free-standing stainless steel blade, smooth cutting, durable. The commercial french fry cutter (cortador de papas fritas) is very suitable for restaurants and home kitchens. Multipurpose Vegetables Fruits Chopper: The stainless steel french fries cutter is equipped with 2 blades 1/2”, 3/8”, which is sharp and sturdy. Each blade set comes with corresponding push block. You can use this metal french fry cutter to cut vegetables into different sizes and shapes according to their own needs. It can be used to cut potatoes, carrots, cucumbers and other vegetables and fruits. Effort-saving & Efficient: Extended handle makes everything easier to make homemade fries. With a single lever action you can squeeze through potatoes with ease, and help you save time and energy. Whether it's for business or using it at home with family and friends, the handheld veggie cutter is your competent assistant. Stable & Safe: The fry maker cutter with 4 powerful suction cups, which can withstand a force of 100kg, so that the machine can be placed stably on the table during the fast cutting process, not easy to slide, and can be cut with one hand! For added convenience, the machine has four pre-drilled screw holes provided, you can install your multifunction vegetable cutter slicer into the wall or a cutting board for even more convenience for your use. Easy to Clean: The blades and push block are both removable and washable with water after using. We have specially equipped a kitchen crevice cleaning brush with 2 brush heads. The blade is sharp, pay attention to safety when cleaning, replacing and storing! Dry storage is required after cleaning! Your satisfaction is our greatest motivation, if any needs or questions, don't hesitate to contact us, you can contact us through e-mail, lurexes@163.com","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aJ1ap6iyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lurexes","source_asin":"B0B5TXLG65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1075953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TXLG65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TXLG65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
